{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591390/extras/ccc1e0739b6b4273be550dc166c2b434.avif?t=1759972434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591390/extras_big/ccc1e0739b6b4273be550dc166c2b434.webp?t=1759972434 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through action-packed stages as brave Vivi and stealthy Alps in this side-scrolling adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivi can take the fight to her foes in fast-paced combat, while Alps is weaker and must use her cunning to outfox her opponents. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, shoot, and slash your way through painterly stages and colorful enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with your allies in between the action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each heroine's strengths to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful spells to dominate every obstacle!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591390?t=1759972434","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591390/4ec29b7aefc598f47c2a9dccd8daf3a75146b61f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759972434","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591390/fae5b36d6f55cff8d07993030e8ba76a16a587c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759972434","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591390/fae5b36d6f55cff8d07993030e8ba76a16a587c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759972434","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ag